  /// { "isWriterGraphic": true }
  ///
  /// 2) when the selected object is a chart legend:
  ///
  /// { "isDraggable": true, "isResizable": true, "isRotatable": false }
  ///
  /// 3) when the selected object is a pie segment in a chart:
